	<section_number>10.1-549</section_number>
	<catch_line>Cooperation between districts</catch_line>
	<text>
		The directors of any two or more districts may cooperate in the exercise of any or all powers conferred in this chapter.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 21-4; 1970, c. 480; 1988, c. 891.</history>
